  "details": "There are many mods that vrc users use from QoL to performance and aids for people with special requirements. \nMany people will want QoL mods to make their experience more comfortable and enjoyable. You are only pushing people away by taking this away from the users.\nPerformance is another thing. As seen, vrc can be taxing on pc hardware as there is lots to render. Having more specific performance options will allow more people to play the game as they will be able to customise their settings so they can reach an optimal fps thats not sickening to look at.\nAids for people with things such as epilepsy or mutes are no longer accessible without the mods. An example is the speech to text mod allowing those who dont want to talk have an option of quick communication. \nI trust you will make the right decision for your loving user base so you can further grow on a positive arch,\nThank you",
